<title>JAPAN: U.S., Japan agree Japan to intervene alone -- Jiji.</title>
<headline>U.S., Japan agree Japan to intervene alone -- Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese and U.S. authorities have agreed Japan will intervene on its own in currency markets if the yen falls sharply, Jiji news agency quoted international monetary sources as saying.</p>
</text>
